1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,796
Is this Black Friday deal

2
00:00:01,796 --> 00:00:04,338
real, or fake?
One prompt tells you.

3
00:00:04,338 --> 00:00:05,455
Here's the trick.

4
00:00:05,455 --> 00:00:07,622
Some stores raise
the "was" price

5
00:00:07,622 --> 00:00:09,461
a few weeks
before the sale,

6
00:00:09,461 --> 00:00:11,334
so the discount
looks huge.

7
00:00:11,334 --> 00:00:13,201
In the EU, that old price

8
00:00:13,201 --> 00:00:14,992
must be the lowest price

9
00:00:14,992 --> 00:00:16,635
from the last 30 days.

10
00:00:16,635 --> 00:00:18,676
Not every shop plays fair.

11
00:00:18,676 --> 00:00:20,007
So copy this prompt

12
00:00:20,007 --> 00:00:21,478
into any free chatbot

13
00:00:21,478 --> 00:00:23,259
that can search the web.

14
00:00:23,259 --> 00:00:24,763
Paste the product link,

15
00:00:24,763 --> 00:00:27,152
the sale price
and the "was" price.

16
00:00:27,152 --> 00:00:28,812
It looks up recent prices,

17
00:00:28,812 --> 00:00:30,345
checks two other stores,

18
00:00:30,345 --> 00:00:31,622
and gives a verdict:

19
00:00:31,622 --> 00:00:34,148
real deal, fake discount,
or not sure.

20
00:00:34,148 --> 00:00:35,734
Here, it says not sure:

21
00:00:35,734 --> 00:00:37,321
no price history found.

22
00:00:37,321 --> 00:00:39,076
That's a reason to wait.

23
00:00:39,076 --> 00:00:41,590
Always click the sources
before you buy.

24
00:00:41,590 --> 00:00:43,127
Screenshot the prompt,

25
00:00:43,127 --> 00:00:44,875
and send it to the friend

26
00:00:44,875 --> 00:00:46,862
who's about to
buy that TV.

27
00:00:46,862 --> 00:00:49,276
Follow for one
AI shortcut a day.
